error[bang-convention]: method of `normalize` writes `v`, but name has no `!`
 --> src/BangConventionPositive.jl:5:1
  |
5 | normalize(v::Vector{Float64}) = (v ./= sum(v); v)
  | ^^^^^^^^^ name has no `!`
  | ------------------------------------------------- writes `v`
  |
  = why: caller reads name without `!` as promise that call changes nothing it can see
  = fix: rename `normalize` to `normalize!`, with call sites   [manual]
  = docs: corset explain bang-convention
  = note: deny from correctness group, library preset
  = note: opt out with `# corset: allow bang-convention -- <reason>`

